  (text "Keying logic (control board) -- PTT inputs from the rear jacks + top-panel buttons, override / mute logic, indicators, power-on hold." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "220982ed-935d-52e5-be42-9facadbac1f8"))
  (text "Logic (0/+9V, active high): PTT_x = keyed (2k2 pull-up, ~7.4 V loaded); PTT_ACTIVE = A or B (~6.8 V) -> 2N7002 open-drain to the rig, intercom lockout, TX lamp." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 26.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2b247551-4c2e-59df-ae8b-1733f32d56c7"))
  (text "OVERRIDE (DPDT on-off-on, top panel): A->B keys the rig from A and mutes B; B->A mirror. MUTE_x = latching button OR override OR (JP70x: not keyed) OR power-on hold. All logic transistors are 2N7002 so no base current loads the logic highs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ed86686f-389e-5166-b9a0-69c775165d61"))
  (text "OVERRIDE (SW703, on-off-on): A->B / centre OFF / B->A as marked on the top panel" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 109.22 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8f29d48a-e850-5c78-ad0b-9de32e191970"))
  (text "JP701/JP702 (PTT GATE): mic live only while keyed" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 118.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c1c98c73-37d5-5217-86be-33f35b474e35"))
  (text "INDICATORS: TX lamp (17 mA, prominent), per-channel PTT and MUTE, power. Intercom LED is on the TX Sum sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0dbde41a-c13b-5685-b025-e48f57f0bc21"))
  (text "All LEDs run from the raw filtered rail so their step loads never touch the +9V analog rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "32a5ec99-301d-59bf-81e3-39237f71bd12"))
  (text "Power-on hold: MUTE_A/B > 5 V for ~1 s (C710/R731, 1M loads);" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.25 158.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "83f724d2-30bc-51be-adf9-8410fdec04a8"))
  (text "D726 discharges C710 at power-off (quick re-arm)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.25 161.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1910914b-6d5e-5735-b52c-6f5eef7d08a5"))
